10→      "Закрытые P1–P5: Vaulter::drive()->actingAs() и sub-API Operations, snapshot-DTO и Page (P4.13), ContentDelivery strict|direct_signed и DownloadHeaders (P3.7), ShareResolver/ResolveShareToken (P4.10), ResolveCollaborationCall/хаб load-store-fence (P4.5/D36), ProblemException (P1.8), webhooks Actions (P5.4), ChangeOperations (P5.5), RoutesConfig стеки (P1.9)",
